  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:096141bda5b6623fc99bf7a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请用！这是加了自制酱料，\r\n神鹰爸爸认证的辣味巧克力！\r\n我还是第一次送给家人以外的人Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bcfeb056eb62f0449f04243a0e0ddfc99831903aabab70f3a51d2e28545bc72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c6c1d38bca2b9fe144dea5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你已经在签纸上写好愿望了吗？\r\n神鹰的已经完美，无缺，没问题Death！\r\n一起实现「世界最强」这个愿望吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "379b8b531650591698dcfef54e52bf2074e5985abb28d919ad03e1c53d92666a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78d060adfbd8524a7ad3a406",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节快乐啦！Death！\r\n吃完甜食就来吃神鹰特制的\r\n墨西哥辣椒夹饼吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2225687ed0e654dd95341f9f29f96fa62017ce1509203ac1bb61b69b8fd28d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:976739a16af95128e2f7197c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前爸爸常常扮圣诞老人Death。\r\n神秘的蒙面摔跤手……\r\n没错，就是蒙面・之・圣诞老人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20bae9c62b7ac140325ce1301e066acdb228bee4b5e84f81b2558f87fe523cee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc13dc85fe17a9fad3295907",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "豪华，绚烂，圣诞树！\r\n和神鹰一起摆上最顶端的星星吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6ae37b3412b403cfc9cd43df3d0e53bfd4c2bd39ed003461962c4c08eef05c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9dc45ccc11d501d7fc0dc30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利Dea——th！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "704cfe518877d700e40823358a07d49b3880604b6db05277e0e9bd916e2960be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3ca6927316960f424527c58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个时期……差不多要来了呢。\r\n说到年底，就会想到跨年摔跤……！\r\n我现在就已经开始等不及了Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d65db64b4774486720fae0abaca0b6d9de8d70863d9c8e1fbd50e0fe81e09e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14b6d05e00fb315ff144d6df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\r\n我请你到食堂吃\r\n神鹰特制的辣味炸鸡Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57c3f517edae9fffd9d3697183c90f40e1d1dc844dcda130f629c1909fc6f94a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1a95c2dd5a4a4f935aad899",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，我希望你今天能度过\r\nbueno！especial！\r\núltimo！的一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae1b8922daebc77a62fa36fb22d6f03542835a4bb31472ea13312b3d102518db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36fb36a29ab7c51684aefe94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Gracias！谢谢你为我祝贺Death！\r\n今后我们也要继续\r\n作为世界最强搭档在历史上留名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b70259376933c901a2f979b067a43c63600ce694c63c06a69b244fb0bbec9f4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dad267c1019bc153f120fa23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的爸爸妈妈打电话来\r\n祝我生日快乐了！你作为……\r\n神鹰最重要的搭档，要不要也说说话？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a85d61f0394229f9ed6184848dbf73b4d53a8c744f2daec53442193c264afdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbba8ef5974b7ab5704517ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到新公告了耶——！\r\n一起确认内容吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0051c423b41ca162eb4b213d5ad5e0b4ab7cdc8474d5b240ac56f49516f38e79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8bfe5f255094d8b93ff30f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了耶\r\n神鹰也很期待\r\n里面装着什么Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8aea2e49644a6b3079f75bb3a1ca5e1486340376177f61086ec64c61e6fd259",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee2780db3c317371620d8fae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Bueno！\r\n好像有任务完成了Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd99a6fc833340508dc9efa4c4fe8bd09a4f8a7288edc356487e1f734621f8e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5725c3c9450ac8c9abd8565",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就快要比赛……\r\n不对，是要举办活动了Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98543892f34726f457ac4323953ae74f99cb02b5282049cdebc0c51b46071685",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:effee3b8567c7fcb422f4725",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在好评举办中～！\r\n我们也不能错过了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8df5f6732d2db9099bb317b0d0f28a8b84f51edf48b19723aeb0a87a55ba5c90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cdfa61c78ba05f44648d253",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不甘心Dea——th！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e1f694225bfc8ab6de3d2aefd487e0a73f44828219a53f26fe6d7e72b085518",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4688da6814eca7213bd8a1d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴等级提——升！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab738f857b8db5b30324659788ec3801f1dcd741a5e9a4a3ccbcd9396674f19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04daa300139a0655fb7f9325",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这衬衫沾了汗也很干爽\r\n…很适合外出时容易热出汗\r\n的小鹰Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23f5988d106cc50eb545dfb661e03b0addbc1ec8486c3e38c1d2022be9d0638d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad3ac09e1350ea0eba36ed92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Yellow＆Red是热情之色！\r\n…而且是能让擂台上的爸爸注意到自己\r\n的显眼之色Death。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7436d3ac49d10ae3f7a76c0105079bcbbc0bc7321aab794e54ae5991afaca956",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9334702cfea10f75f831a8af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打扮、外出、享受～♪\r\n最近有场超级热烈的职业摔跤赛\r\n…要一起去看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4b1184a4668d88175035d90730ffb7120510e6c9316d860b00e3b5473398dd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
